&lt;p&gt;Here I just wanted to give some background information on me and this challenge. This is a challenge developed by the National Security Agency that takes place over several months and tests various technical and logical skills. Out of any CTF challenge I&amp;rsquo;ve done, this has been my favorite by far. Here I&amp;rsquo;m just going to talk about how I solved these challenges, some other methods to solve them, and some of my mistakes along the way.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>